Digivice for AYN Thor
=====================

Independent Android app for the AYN Thor, based on Digivice by Jean Carlos Heck.
Unofficial fan project with no affiliation with Bandai Namco. This repository and
the APK do not contain files from Digimon World 2003: the app generates its game
material on the console from the user's own copy.

