Digivice, by Jean Carlos Heck
-----------------------------

This app is based on Digivice, the second-screen companion for Digimon World 2003
on Windows created by Jean Carlos Heck. The domain core, many tables, presenters,
the English texts and the memory definitions come from his work, and his commits
are kept in this repository's history. He authorised publishing this Android version.

  Repository: https://github.com/jeanheck/digivice
  Ko-fi:      https://ko-fi.com/R5R028MD8Y

The inherited code is published with its author's permission, and his commits
keep his authorship in the history of this repository.


