markisha64/ddw3
---------------

https://github.com/markisha64/ddw3

Research on the game's map, tile, sprite and text formats, used as a reference for
the extractor and the development scripts in Tools/RomExtract and Tools/FieldData.
The table of the game's character codes that the extractor uses to decode text
(Android/extractor/src/main/resources/extractor/charset.json) is generated from
its codepoint list by Tools/FieldData/generate_text_keys.py. ddw3 is not vendored
here, and it declares no licence.


